ear, I start online.","w":0.41739128112792967,"x":0.50652175595777427,"h":0.011809895950088189,"y":0.64970930253847992},{"h":0.013134778839518968,"w":0.14347826004028308,"x":0.50434782769724973,"text":"There is a lot of 'a","y":0.66424418600091795},{"w":0.2065217399597169,"x":0.71739130135166329,"y":0.66569282134871366,"h":0.013086248518827559,"text":"g showing perfect models"},{"text":"wearing nice clothes. They 2c","y":0.68023255854623177,"h":0.011754085703166828,"x":0.50434783274934192,"w":0.219565200805664},{"x":0.77608696070843242,"text":"_mthat ifl buy their","w":0.14782608032226563,"y":0.68023255849778219,"h":0.01175408610119455},{"text":"clothes, I will look and feel as wonderful as they do. But","h":0.01043405676126874,"y":0.696160266925691,"x":0.50652174552299167,"w":0.41739128112792978},{"h":0.010174418530599527,"x":0.50434783809163375,"w":0.42173912048339846,"text":"I know that's not true. I look at a website for about an hour","y":0.71075581391783971},{"y":0.72529069785097999,"h":0.011771071932351607,"x":0.50652175595777427,"text":"and decide to go to a shopping centre. It's frustrating","w":0.41739128112792967},{"y":0.73802944813227223,"w":0.41769260406494146,"h":0.014932243175220017,"text":"because there are always crowds of people and long","x":0.50637311561051745},{"x":0.50217391374907971,"h":0.014534883387697706,"w":0.023913042545318675,"text":"3q.","y":0.7543604652538255},{"w":0.16521738052368162,"x":0.57826087220192735,"text":"s. But at least I can 4t","y":0.75581395364652193,"h":0.010174418530599527},{"h":0.0087209297141964681,"text":"some","w":0.054347825050354071,"y":0.7572674420469715,"x":0.86956521858895341},{"text":"of the clothes to see how I look. I usually look ridiculous","y":0.77034883756754979,"w":0.41739128112792967,"h":0.011788057365481164,"x":0.50652175307733938},{"y":0.78631051733241941,"w":0.41956520080566406,"h":0.010201110664711632,"x":0.50434783880912437,"text":"- the latest trends are not for me. But I see they are"},{"w":0.1